# Vitest

- Colocate: `src/package/ui/components/<name>/<name>.test.tsx`
- Required before marking part/component **Completed**
- Assert roles, state, keyboard, data/aria attrs — not className snapshots
- CLI: no default tests
- Run `npm test` before claiming a chunk works
